| `test/vary.js` | Troy Goode | 100% (36 lines) |
| `test/issue-2.js` | Troy Goode | 83% |
| `test/example-app.js` | Troy Goode | 83% |
| `test/error-response.js` | Troy Goode | 86% |
| `README.md` | Troy Goode | 54%, with Jon Church 33% and Linus Unnebäck 12% |
| `.eslintrc.yml`, `test/.eslintrc.yml`, `test/support/env.js` | Wilson | 100%, but only 2–7 lines each |
| `.github/workflows/scorecard.yml` | Íñigo Marquínez Prado | 94% |
| `.github/workflows/codeql.yml` | Sebastian Beltran | 95% |
| `.github/dependabot.yml` | Ulises Gascón | 100% |

**Shared ownership**
- `test/test.js`, the main test suite: Wilson 339 lines, Goode 317 lines.
- `.github/workflows/ci.yml`: Wilson 118 lines, Ignacio Mangas 44, Gascón 30.
- `package.json` and `HISTORY.md`: Wilson owns most of both. `HISTORY.md` is 85% Wilson.

**Risk assessment**
- **Troy Goode is the main risk.** They wrote most of `lib/index.js` and nearly all the older tests.
  - Their last commits are 2026-04-10, the most recent author dates I checked, so they may still be active.
  - Wilson is the only other significant contributor to the core code, and he is mostly in the release and tooling files.
- **CI and security workflows** each depend on one person: Marquínez Prado (scorecard), Beltran (codeql) and Gascón (dependabot). They are small, self-contained config files. Replacing the owner is easy, so the impact is low.
- **Recent activity** is spread across many people, but the commits are small:
  - Over the last two years there were 11 Dependabot commits.
  - Gascón and Jon Church made 3 commits each.
  - Beltran, Mangas and Troy Goode made 2 each.
  - No recent contributor has taken over `lib/index.js`.

**Caveats**
- Blame shows who last touched a line, not who understands the code. Sole-author lines are a proxy for knowledge, not proof of it.
- Git shows the same person under different emails. Troy Goode appears under `<email redacted>` and `troy@laptop.example`. I merged them by name. I did not merge other identities, so some counts may be slightly low.
- I excluded `62628c0` from blame, along with whitespace changes. Without that, "Fiona Formatter" would own most lines.

**Suggested actions**
- Have a second person review or co-own `lib/index.js`.
- Document the intent behind `test/vary.js`, since only Goode has touched it.

